  "description": "Theo, a man who lost his eyesight from the shock of losing his wife in a fire five years ago.  \nRenée was found in the forest five years earlier with severe burns on her face. Having lost all her memories, she has since lived as a maid, enduring abuse from a cruel baron.  \nOne day, Theo happens to visit the baron's mansion as a guest. Realizing how wealthy Theo is, the baron threatens Renée and orders her to seduce him.  \nAs the two gradually become drawn to each other through a strange sense of familiarity, they begin to uncover a terrifying truth.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13553232)    \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13553517)",
